; The 1st Doctor's console room (the default one). The room's id is permanent: RetroXR keeps its save slots under it.
; Everything else is built by console_room.gd from the GLB and its JSON. The player comes in at the door (+Z),
; facing the console at the middle (-Z). A bright white room: high ambient light, cool white roundel wash, a warm bulb
; in the rotor (ConsoleRooms.lights).
